{
  "bodyHash": "CtzJjdUNs64=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組包。用心打造。Serilum 的模組組合，方便下載！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"關於模組包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>生活品質模組包</strong>是一種特殊類型的模組，將 Serilum 的多個<strong>生活品質類</strong>模組合而為一。雖然我覺得將模組歸類在一起非常困難，但我還是嘗試這麼做，讓安裝更簡單。它使用一種稱為 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系統。這基本上意味著包含的模組保持完全獨立，同時允許像模組包一樣打包安裝。所有模組仍然有自己的設定檔，而且您會在遊戲內的模組清單中看到它們全部列出。<br><br>這個模組包是模組包開發的額外輔助工具，但不會取代我個人偏好的模組化模組系統。不過，您可以透過模組包的設定來停用包含的模組。<strong>需要重新啟動才能讓變更生效。</strong><br><br>由於 JiJ 系統的運作方式，它與正常安裝模組以及同時安裝模組包中的包含模組是相容的。這主要可用於強制使用特定版本，但如果意外以這種方式安裝了兩次模組，也不會造成問題。雖然可能不會有問題，但當然最好只安裝一次。因此，如果您決定安裝此模組包，可以移除其中包含的任何其他模組。<br><br>我希望這個模組包對那些偏好大型內容模組的人有所幫助。非常感謝多年來的所有支持！<br><br></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：用戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAlwaysaWitherSkull</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAutomaticDoors</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBetterBeaconPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBetterConduitPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBetterSpawnerControl</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBottledAir</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCompactHelpCommand</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableConduitsPreventDrowned</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCyclePaintings</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDismountEntity</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEasyElytraTakeoff</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEnchantingCommands</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableExtendedBoneMeal</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFurnaceRecycle</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHoeTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableInventoryTotem</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableKeepMySoilTilled</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableKelpFertilizer</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMoveBoats</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMoveMinecarts</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNoAnimalTemptDelay</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNoFeatherTrample</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNutritiousMilk</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableOreHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableQuickPaths</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableQuickRightClick</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRecast</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableReplantingCrops</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRespawningShulkers</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableScaffoldingDropsNearby</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSleepSooner</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSofterHayBales</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStackRefill</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStickyEnchantingLapis</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSuperflatWorldNoSlimes</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSurfaceMushrooms</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableThornyBushProtection</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableTreeHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableUnderwaterEnchanting</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableVillageBellRecipe</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableWoolTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableYourItemsAreSafe</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableZombieProofDoors</strong>&nbsp;(預設值 = true)</span></div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用模組包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下是可用的 Serilum 模組包：</span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 的用戶端模組包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 的自訂模組包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 的額外模組包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 的生活品質模組包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 的 RPG 模組包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 的生成模組包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/always-a-wither-skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/always-a-wither-skull.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/always-a-wither-skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">凋零骷髏頭顱總是掉落</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓凋零骷髏在死亡時總是掉落其頭顱。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/automatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/automatic-doors.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/automatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自動門</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">自動為玩家開啟周圍的門，並在可設定的延遲後關閉。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-beacon-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-beacon-placement.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-beacon-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的烽火台放置</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">透過對烽火台右鍵點擊礦物方塊，輕鬆放置烽火台基座。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-conduit-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-conduit-placement.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-conduit-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的海靈核心放置</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">將海靈核心放置在前方，更便於放置海磷石磚，以及其他調整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-spawner-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-spawner-control.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-spawner-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的生怪磚控制</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當生怪磚被5根火把包圍時，停用其生怪功能。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bottled-air\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bottled-air.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bottled-air\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">瓶裝空氣</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家在水下對著空玻璃瓶呼吸，以獲得更多氧氣。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compact-help-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/compact-help-command.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compact-help-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精簡幫助指令</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">修改 /help 指令以顯示所有資訊，使其色彩豐富且支援多頁顯示。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conduits-prevent-drowned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/conduits-prevent-drowned.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conduits-prevent-drowned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">海靈核心防止沉屍</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在海靈核心效果啟動時，禁止沉屍在玩家周圍生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cycle-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cycle-paintings.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cycle-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">循環畫作</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">手持另一幅畫對已放置的畫作右鍵點擊，即可輕鬆循環切換畫作。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dismount-entity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/dismount-entity.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dismount-entity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">卸下實體</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家從騎乘的實體/生物上卸下/移除/脫離，而不會破壞它們。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elytra-takeoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elytra-takeoff.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elytra-takeoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易鞘翅起飛</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家在地面上使用煙火從鞘翅/滑翔翼輕鬆起飛，無需跳躍。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/enchanting-commands.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔指令</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">透過指令輕鬆創建（模組）附魔物品，且等級可超過預設上限。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-bone-meal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extended-bone-meal.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-bone-meal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">強化骨粉</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">擴展骨粉功能。蹲下時可立即生長，可用於地獄疙瘩、仙人掌、甘蔗等。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/furnace-recycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/furnace-recycle.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/furnace-recycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">熔爐回收</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">所有含金屬的物品皆可在熔爐中回收，變回原物料。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hoe-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.c