k\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">快速右鍵點擊</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">為特定物品增加便攜功能，無需放置即可快速使用。適用於床、工作台、終界箱和界伏盒等。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/recast.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自動拋竿</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當釣到物品時，自動為玩家重新拋出釣竿。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replanting-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/replanting-crops.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replanting-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">作物自動補種</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使用鋤頭收穫作物後，自動利用掉落物重新種植/替換/播種。支援模組掉落物、胡蘿蔔、馬鈴薯、甜菜根、地獄疙瘩、可可豆和小麥。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respawning-shulkers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/respawning-shulkers.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respawning-shulkers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">界伏蚌重生</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">界伏蚌在死亡地點經過可設定的延遲後會重生，可持續取得貝殼。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scaffolding-drops-nearby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/scaffolding-drops-nearby.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scaffolding-drops-nearby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鷹架就近掉落</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">破壞鷹架方塊時，所有相連的方塊都會掉落在此方塊位置。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-sooner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sleep-sooner.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-sooner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">早點睡覺</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">也能晚點睡！讓玩家在不同的時間上床睡覺。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/softer-hay-bales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/softer-hay-bales.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/softer-hay-bales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">柔軟乾草捆</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓乾草捆完全消除掉落傷害，刺客教條風格。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-refill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stack-refill.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-refill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品堆自動補充</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當玩家使用最後一個物品時，如果存在替代品，自動補充玩家手上的物品。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sticky-enchanting-lapis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sticky-enchanting-lapis.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sticky-enchanting-lapis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔台青金石保留</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許青金石留在附魔台中，並可與其他玩家共享。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superflat-world-no-slimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/superflat-world-no-slimes.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superflat-world-no-slimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">超平坦世界無史萊姆</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當你在超平坦世界嘗試創作時，移除那些煩人的史萊姆。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surface-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/surface-mushrooms.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surface-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地表蘑菇</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">蘑菇可以在白天且任何亮度下放置於地表。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thorny-bush-protection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/thorny-bush-protection.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thorny-bush-protection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">尖刺叢林防護</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">玩家穿著護腿時，穿越甜莓灌木叢不會受到傷害。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tree-harvester.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">樹木收穫機</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">用斧頭瞬間收穫整棵樹和巨型蘑菇。包含快速落葉和樹苗種植。也適用於扭曲（地獄）樹。讓你快速成為砍樹大師。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underwater-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/underwater-enchanting.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underwater-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">水下附魔</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許在水下使用附魔台，並透過書櫃達到最高等級。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-bell-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/village-bell-recipe.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-bell-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村莊鐘合成配方</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓村莊鐘可以透過合成配方製作。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wool-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/wool-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wool-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">羊毛調整</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">對羊毛類型方塊的合成配方、線的轉換以及染色過程進行多項調整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-items-are-safe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/your-items-are-safe.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-items-are-safe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">你的物品安全了</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">玩家死亡時會生成一個箱子與盔甲架來保存物品，作為墓碑的替代方案。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-proof-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-proof-doors.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-proof-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍防禦門</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止殭屍鎖定並破壞門。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"筆記與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此組合包，只要下載內容仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中一一跟進留言，因此留言功能已關閉。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事宜，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
